  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hi, thanks for Avatar 3.0, it's really fun to make avatars. \nYou know how the player's voice has a max distance of 40 meters? Could you make an an auto-fix feature for the Avatar 3.0 SDK so that before uploading, there's an auto fix for max distance for audio sources so that an entrance sound or emote gets auto corrected to 40 meters if the max distance is greater than 40 meters?\nThe max distance for 3d sound settings in an audio source in unity is 500 meters by default and many people forget to change the max distance before uploading and can be heard very far away. Thank you.",
